# Tam, the Possibility with no planeswalker: X is zero, so the ability proliferates zero times and no question is asked
# (the bare refusal holds; CR 701.34a). The Everflowing Chalice on the battlefield has a charge counter and would be a
# candidate, so an X counted from permanents with counters - or any nonzero X - would ask and fail the refusal. It keeps
# its single charge counter.

